sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Clinician
    participant API as Portal API
    participant G as PHI guard
    participant P as Pipeline (async)
    participant S as Sources
    participant M as MongoDB

    C->>API: POST /api/search-sessions {question}
    API->>G: screen(question)
    alt PHI detected
        G-->>API: blocked
        API->>M: persist status=blocked_phi (no question text)
        API-->>C: 200 blocked_phi
    else clean
        API->>M: persist status=searching, sanitized_question
        API-->>C: 200 session id
        API->>P: fire pipeline(session)
        P->>S: parse + federated retrieval
        P->>M: dedup + rank -> search_session_articles
        P->>S: access broker (+ optional OA fetch)
        P->>M: status=awaiting_selection
    end
    C->>API: GET /api/search-sessions/{id}/status (poll)
